      "rationale": "Scope/breadth is a sensible signal for achievability. Sample rows are all single_initiative, plausibly grounded, though distinguishing multi_department/enterprise_wide from often-terse text carries some inference risk not verifiable here."
    },
    {
      "name": "timeline_horizon",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.85,
      "source_groundedness": 0.85,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
